                      "emailMessage/Body": "<p class=\"editor-paragraph\">Hi @{body('Get_Client_Approver_by_ID')?['fullname']},</p><br><p class=\"editor-paragraph\">@{body('Get_Candidate_by_ID')?['fullname']} has submitted their timesheet for approval. However, before accessing the timesheet open for submission. Please click the link below to complete your registration process:</p>\n<br>\n<a href = \"@{parameters('Quickshifts Portal (new_QuickshiftsPortal)')}/registration/?contactid=@{triggerOutputs()?['body/_new_approverid_value']}\">Registration</a>\n<br>\n<br>Once you have completed your registration process. Please can you approve, or reject the timesheet at your earliest convenience using the link below:\n<br>\n<a href = \"@{parameters('Quickshifts Portal (new_QuickshiftsPortal)')}/assignments/activetimesheets/timesheetdetails/?timesheetid=@{triggerOutputs()?['body/new_timesheetid']}&clientid=@{outputs('Get_Placement_by_ID')?['body/_new_clientid_value']}&contactid=@{triggerOutputs()?['body/_new_approverid_value']}\">@{triggerOutputs()?['body/new_name']}</a>\n<br>\nThank you,Timesheets System",
